---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="Rachel Flower — somatic practitioner, breathwork facilitator, and sound healer guiding you home to your body."
>
	<section class="page-hero section section--tight">
		<div class="wrap wrap--narrow reveal">
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
			<h1>My story</h1>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section about-body">
		<div class="wrap about-grid">
			<figure class="about-portrait reveal">
				<img
					src="/images/Rachel_Flowers.webp"
					alt="Rachel Flower"
					width="800"
					height="1000"
					loading="eager"
				/>
			</figure>
			<div class="about-copy reveal reveal-delay-1">
				<p class="lead">I am Rachel. I’ve walked through fire and emerged holding flowers.</p>
				<p>
					Stage 4 cancer became one of my greatest teachers. It stripped life down to what was
					essential and invited me into radical aliveness. My healing journey did not make me
					perfect or fearless. It made me honest. It taught me that every breath is a doorway, every
					sensation a message, every moment a chance to remember who we really are.
				</p>
				<p>Now I guide others through the sacred doorways of their own becoming.</p>
				<p>
					Here, we do not rush to fix what is not broken. We listen. We honor the wisdom already
					living in your body and nervous system. We remember what was never truly lost.
				</p>
				<p>
					Through breath, sound, and somatic presence, I hold a field where your system can settle,
					unwind, and reorganize around deeper truth. This is presence meeting presence. Soul
					recognizing soul. You are not a problem to solve — you are a living, breathing process to
					be met with care.
				</p>
				<p>
					I am a somatic practitioner, breathwork facilitator, sound healer, and trauma-informed
					plant medicine guide. With decades of somatic training and more than twelve years of
					apprenticeship and study with pioneers in the plant medicine world, I bring together
					nervous system science, deep ritual, and gentle, grounded spirituality.
				</p>
				<p>
					My work is simple at its core: I help you come home to your body, trust your own knowing,
					and breathe life back into the parts of you that are ready to blossom.
				</p>
				<p class="about-cta">
					<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/offerings">View offerings</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<figure class="bleed reveal" aria-hidden="true">
		<img
			src="/images/unsplash-image-hjmED1qivmc.webp"
			alt=""
			width="1600"
			height="900"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
	</figure>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page-hero {
		padding-bottom: 0;
	}

	.page-hero h1 {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.about-body {
		padding-top: var(--space-lg);
	}

	.about-grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: var(--space-lg);
		align-items: start;
	}

	@media (min-width: 900px) {
		.about-grid {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
			gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
		}
	}

	.about-portrait {
		margin: 0;
		position: sticky;
		top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 1rem);
	}

	.about-portrait img {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.about-copy .lead {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 1.55rem);
		line-height: 1.45;
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}

	.about-copy p {
		color: var(--color-ink-soft);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.about-cta {
		margin-top: var(--space-md);
	}

	@media (max-width: 899px) {
		.about-portrait {
			position: static;
		}
	}
</style>
